{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8ad920a3b55b33d7","name":"Shaper","source":{"id":"source:reference-8ad920a3b55b33d7","title":"Shaper","revision":20302,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:35:54Z","sha256":"844024d439144a888588140302dcaa98ce3ae050c7c5ac926f4e39063679ecf3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20302","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shaper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8ad920a3b55b33d7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Among the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},", Shapers are the engineers of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Biotechnology"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Biotechnology"},". Their skills afford them special distinction and allow them to command great respect in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," society. Nearly everything used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Yuuzhan Vong Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Yuuzhan_Vong_Empire","referenceId":"reference:418e7b3078742a07"},", from their world-affecting terraformers to simple garments, are manufactured by Shapers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Shapers once adhered to strict protocols that acted as blueprints for their creations. Violation of Shaper protocols could result in harsh punishments and accusations of heresy, but during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Era"}," these repercussions are generally ignored by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," who are far removed from their people. This allows some Shapers to use their biotechnical expertise on non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},"- a practice that is unpredictable and oftentimes abominable.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Examples of Shapers in Star Wars:"]}," Ahsi Yim, Ch'Gang Hool, Ghithra Dal, Kae Kwaad, Kotaa Zun-qin, Mezhan Kwaad, Nen Yim, Qelah Kwaad, Suung Aruh, Taug Molou, Tih Qiqah, Tjulan Kwaad, Tsun Qel, Yakun Kwaad, Yal Phaath, Zhul Yim.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," To qualify to become a Shaper, a character must fulfill the following criteria:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Minimum Level:"]}," 7th"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Biotech Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Biotech_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:c3291c1ee29e9f3c"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skills"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Life Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Life_Sciences)"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}]}]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Game Rule Information"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","c